9700740,2024-08-03,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Improper use of your report,Reporting company used your report improperly,"I, have submitted multiple requests to opt out of information sharing with CB INDIGO, and these requests have been denied and ignored, in violation of my legal rights. 
