Legal Rights and Violations : Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ) : According to 15 USC 1681 section 602 ( a ), consumer reporting agencies must exercise responsibilities with fairness, impartiality, and respect for privacy. I have the right to ensure my private information is not shared without my consent. 
