9829364,2024-08-16,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Problem with a company's investigation into an existing problem,Their investigation did not fix an error on your report,"Complaint Regarding Failure to Remove Identity Theft Information from Credit Report Consumer is writing to file a formal complaint against the credit reporting agencies XXXX, Equifax XXXX XXXX for failing to remove fraudulent information from consumers credit report, despite consumers repeated requests and compliance with all necessary procedures. 

