9904622,2024-08-23,Checking or savings account,Checking account,Managing an account,Problem using a debit or ATM card,"Dear CFPB, My Claim Number : XXXX Account number : XXXX I am writing to formally request your assistance in resolving an issue against JPMorgan Chase Bank regarding Unauthorized charges on my account. Both transactions occurred on XX/XX/XXXX, with a posting date of XX/XX/XXXX. Each charge was exactly {$1000.00}, resulting in a total of {$2000.00} for the two charges from XXXX. 
