9904876,2024-08-23,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Account information incorrect,"Re : Formal Complaint Against XXXX XXXX XXXX and Credit Bureaus for Re-Aging My Credit Report and Multiple Violations To Whom It May Concern, I am writing to file a formal complaint against XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX and the credit bureaus ( XXXX, TransUnion, and XXXX ) for multiple violations related to the improper reporting of a debt that has been incorrectly attributed to me. Specifically, XXXX XXXX XXXX has re-aged my credit report, failed to validate the debt within the legally required 30-day period, and engaged in practices that violate the Fair Debt Collection Practices Act ( FDCPA ) and the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ). 

